 eradication of polio</article-title><source>Trop Doct</source><year>2007</year><volume>37</volume><fpage>125</fpage><lpage>126</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17540110</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1258/004947507780609301</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wiysonge</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Mawo</surname><given-names>JN</given-names></name><name><surname>Ticha</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Nomo</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Shey</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Migration and measles</article-title><source>Int J Epidemiol</source><year>2005</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>1443</fpage><lpage>1444</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16172100</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/ije/dyi197</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wiysonge</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Nomo</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Mawo</surname><given-names>JN</given-names></name><name><surname>Ticha</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Accelerated measles control in sub-Saharan Africa</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2006</year><volume>367</volume><fpage>394</fpage><lpage>395</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16458759</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(06)68133-6</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>World Health Organization</collab></person-group><article-title>Yellow fever, 1996&#x02013;1997 &#x02013; part II</article-title><source>Wkly Epidemiol Rec</source><year>1998</year><volume>73</volume><fpage>370</fpage><lpage>372</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9844551</